<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001:m0000" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">鬱林王何妃</persName>名<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001:m0006" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">婧英</persName>廬江灊人撫軍將軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001:m0016" ref="pbz_pni_tco_A">戢</persName>之女也永明二年納為南郡王妃十一年為皇太孫妃<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001:m0038" ref="iop_ybd_afm">鬱林王</persName>即位為<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001:m0044" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">皇后</persName>嫡母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001:m0048" ref="7er_nz6_bcf">劉氏</persName>為高昌縣都鄉君所生母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001:m0060" ref="aef_j2f_3lc">宋氏</persName>為餘杭廣昌鄉君將拜鏡在床無故墮地其冬與<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p001:m0081" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">太后</persName>同日謁太廟</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">后稟性淫亂為妃時便與外人姦通在後宮復通帝左右<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p002:m0022" ref="ur2_4yl_xwz">楊珉之</persName>與同寢處如伉儷<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p002:m0032" ref="ur2_4yl_xwz">珉之</persName>又與帝相愛褻故帝恣之迎<rs id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p002:u0045" type="unresolved">后親戚</rs>入宮賞賜人百數十萬以<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p002:m0058" ref="kix_r92_2ed">世祖</persName>耀靈殿處后家屬<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p002:m0067" ref="iop_ybd_afm">帝</persName>被廢<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hejingying-wyd:p002:m0070" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">后</persName>貶為王妃</p>
</text>
